00:14:41,940 --> 00:14:45,357
Turning into a giant
sure is exhausting work.

265
00:14:45,440 --> 00:14:47,240
Shushu, behind you! Huh?

266
00:14:50,480 --> 00:14:53,220
So there was another one hiding nearby.

267
00:14:53,780 --> 00:14:54,610
Sneaky.

268
00:15:01,960 --> 00:15:04,100
Always keeping me on my toes!

269
00:15:12,620 --> 00:15:15,738
If I don't finish this quick,
things could get hairy.

270
00:15:17,660 --> 00:15:18,820
Paradigm shift!

271
00:15:19,840 --> 00:15:20,670
Huh?

272
00:15:22,960 --> 00:15:23,840
What the?

273
00:15:24,400 --> 00:15:25,300
Oh, crap!

274
00:15:27,260 --> 00:15:28,090
Shushu!

275
00:15:34,400 --> 00:15:36,457
It looks like she's in real trouble.

276
00:15:36,540 --> 00:15:40,280
I want to transform, but without
Miss Kyoka, it's impossible.

277
00:15:42,160 --> 00:15:44,800
There must be something I can do to help.

278
00:15:47,300 --> 00:15:50,297
I transformed when my tongue
touched Miss Kyoka's hand.

279
00:15:50,380 --> 00:15:52,380
So by that logic...

280
00:15:53,820 --> 00:15:54,820
I got it!

281
00:15:58,620 --> 00:16:02,796
If I lick something that belongs to
her, I should be able to transform.

282
00:16:08,040 --> 00:16:11,380
I didn't transform, but
I'm on the right track.

283
00:16:11,720 --> 00:16:14,800
I need something that
provokes a stronger reaction.

284
00:16:19,640 --> 00:16:21,000
Please forgive me.

285
00:16:27,720 --> 00:16:29,560
It worked for a second.

286
00:16:29,960 --> 00:16:31,960
If her shirt does a better job...

287
00:16:35,780 --> 00:16:39,000
Oh God, what does this
say about me as a person?

288
00:16:39,400 --> 00:16:40,580
This is my life now!

289
00:16:47,580 --> 00:16:49,477
There's no time to be indecisive.

290
00:16:49,560 --> 00:16:52,477
If I want to be a hero, I
have to act like a hero.

291
00:16:52,560 --> 00:16:55,960
And if licking her boot makes
my dream come true, I'm in!

292
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:11,140
Maybe I got carried away, whipping
out the jumbo size like that.

293
00:17:11,400 --> 00:17:13,000
A bad habit of mine.

294
00:17:13,320 --> 00:17:15,640
I'm probably going to shrink back soon.

295
00:17:23,560 --> 00:17:27,120
You only transformed halfway
through? That's a first!

296
00:17:27,500 --> 00:17:28,880
But still, I gotta try!

297
00:17:29,100 --> 00:17:29,940
Hold it still!

298
00:17:33,460 --> 00:17:34,580
Come here!

299
00:17:46,400 --> 00:17:47,700
I... did it!

300
00:17:48,200 --> 00:17:49,120
Too late.

301
00:17:49,420 --> 00:17:50,540
I'm out of time.

302
00:17:50,900 --> 00:17:52,197
My body...

303
00:17:52,280 --> 00:17:53,280
won't move.

304
00:17:59,000 --> 00:18:00,820
Hold on! This is it!

305
00:18:01,040 --> 00:18:01,880
No way!

306
00:18:02,060 --> 00:18:03,217
You saved my life, but...

307
00:18:03,300 --> 00:18:05,420
I can't! I'm stuck!

308
00:18:09,220 --> 00:18:10,691
Forcing a transformation?

309
00:18:11,040 --> 00:18:12,746
That's a little over the top.

310
00:18:13,260 --> 00:18:15,740
I did it cuz you said guys are too wimpy.

311
00:18:15,840 --> 00:18:16,697
Be good and stay put.

312
00:18:16,780 --> 00:18:18,956
I wanted to prove that you were wrong

313
00:18:24,660 --> 00:18:26,080
Oh my god!

314
00:18:26,660 --> 00:18:27,760
Hm? No!

315
00:18:27,940 --> 00:18:29,377
I was naked when I transformed!

316
00:18:29,460 --> 00:18:30,817
This isn't what it looks like, okay?

317
00:18:30,900 --> 00:18:33,880
He gets excited whenever
I transform! Calm down!

318
00:18:34,020 --> 00:18:35,037
This isn't the time!

319
00:18:35,120 --> 00:18:36,797
Please, I'm begging you, go down!

320
00:18:36,880 --> 00:18:37,710
Go down!

321
00:18:39,360 --> 00:18:41,680
It's kind of impressive, actually.

322
00:18:45,640 --> 00:18:46,940
Oh, please, Ms.

323
00:18:47,040 --> 00:18:48,511
Kyoka, be gentle with me!

324
00:18:49,060 --> 00:18:50,340
Just lie still!

325
00:18:50,680 --> 00:18:53,017
Out of commission after
a few minutes in combat?

326
00:18:53,100 --> 00:18:54,080
How pathetic.

327
00:18:54,340 --> 00:18:55,460
Oh, shut up!

328
00:18:56,080 --> 00:19:00,177
Listen, shouldn't we fix the cracks in
the barrier that are all around the dorm?

329
00:19:00,260 --> 00:19:01,320
No need to worry.

330
00:19:01,680 --> 00:19:04,417
The barriers protecting
important locations such as our

331
00:19:04,500 --> 00:19:07,377
dormitory and the peach groves
have special properties.

332
00:19:07,460 --> 00:19:10,237
So long as the damage is
minor, it will repair itself.

333
00:19:10,320 --> 00:19:12,980
Oh, it was the same then, too.

334
00:19:16,920 --> 00:19:19,920
But more importantly, quit worming!

335
00:19:22,520 --> 00:19:25,873
This is the reward I get for
forcing myself to transform!

336
00:19:26,260 --> 00:19:29,160
No more slaying Shuki for
kicks, got it, Shushu?

337
00:19:30,380 --> 00:19:33,577
Underestimating your opponent
is how you end up in a body bag.

338
00:19:33,660 --> 00:19:34,490
Yes, ma 'am.

339
00:19:34,573 --> 00:19:35,537
I should have known better.

340
00:19:35,620 --> 00:19:39,017
You can thank Yuki by assisting
him with his household duties.

341
00:19:39,100 --> 00:19:39,930
Right.

342
00:19:45,100 --> 00:19:47,100
Hey, what the hell are you doing?

343
00:19:47,260 --> 00:19:49,554
I'm asserting dominance as your master.

344
00:19:49,740 --> 00:19:53,211
Now you've got me even more
curious about guys than before.

345
00:19:53,320 --> 00:19:55,240
So let's keep our arrangement.

346
00:19:55,400 --> 00:19:57,929
How the hell did you
get the perfect photo?

347
00:19:59,420 --> 00:20:01,840
Well, till next time, Mr. Caretaker.

348
00:20:01,940 --> 00:20:03,220
Wait, don't go yet.

349
00:20:03,900 --> 00:20:06,606
She's got too many
incriminating photos of me.

350
00:20:06,740 --> 00:20:08,477
I can't talk my way out.

351
00:20:08,560 --> 00:20:11,240
Will I ever be free of this torture?

352
00:20:14,920 --> 00:20:17,080
I won't give you up, Yuki.

353
00:20:28,740 --> 00:20:30,240
Go on without me!

354
00:20:31,660 --> 00:20:34,660
Inform the commander ASAP! Roger that!

355
00:20:37,120 --> 00:20:39,200
That's no ordinary Shuuki.

356
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:44,980
Yuna! Karu!

357
00:20:57,600 --> 00:20:59,320
Do not eat her.

358
00:21:18,560 --> 00:21:20,520
I knew I felt it.

359
00:21:21,080 --> 00:21:22,500
I'm positive.

360
00:21:23,160 --> 00:21:25,720
I can feel his presence anywhere.

361
00:21:28,680 --> 00:21:31,060
Yuki is somewhere in Mato.

362
00:21:31,880 --> 00:21:33,900
I'd better pay him a visit.

363
00:21:34,660 --> 00:21:36,160
Oh

364
00:22:13,160 --> 00:22:14,477
Thank

365
00:22:14,560 --> 00:22:15,877
you

366
00:22:15,960 --> 00:22:22,960
so

367
00:22:33,020 --> 00:22:34,620
much for watching.

368
00:22:40,580 --> 00:22:45,300
The sound is stuck in the
canteen I am all right.

369
00:22:45,960 --> 00:22:50,157
I'm not staying here.

370
00:22:50,240 --> 00:22:52,534
I'm going to tip yourself on your feet.

371
00:22:52,640 --> 00:22:56,377
I'm so sad to see you.

372
00:22:56,460 --> 00:22:57,820
With a rope from you.

373
00:22:58,960 --> 00:23:00,780
I'll never get it away.

374
00:23:02,360 --> 00:23:04,257
I'll never let you go.

375
00:23:04,340 --> 00:23:10,097
I'll never let you go.

376
00:23:10,180 --> 00:23:12,120
Teacher's reason why?

377
00:23:12,660 --> 00:23:16,257
Okay, let's talk about Miss Shushu's
speech-ability paradigm shift.

378
00:23:16,340 --> 00:23:19,117
With that, she can alter the
size of her body as well.

379
00:23:19,200 --> 00:23:22,697
But not just that, she can also
alter the size of her clothes.

380
00:23:22,780 --> 00:23:25,015
or even simple objects simultaneously.

381
00:23:25,300 --> 00:23:27,417
It comes in handy when
moving to a new house.

382
00:23:27,500 --> 00:23:29,937
By the way, the dorm has
its own Wi-Fi network.

383
00:23:30,020 --> 00:23:30,850
Ms.

384
00:23:30,933 --> 00:23:33,477
Shushu spends a lot of time
playing online multiplayer games.

385
00:23:33,560 --> 00:23:35,207
She lets Snake join in, too!

386
00:23:35,460 --> 00:23:38,460
Anyway, next time,
encounter Kyouka Rampage.
